--   Bundesliga: 146 rows, 137 accepted (137 market moves, 0 already at the club, 14 with add data (14 of them from the 2026 row), 0 market rows inserted, 137 stints), 7 also in an earlier file, 2 refused
--   Serie A: 155 rows, 134 accepted (134 market moves, 0 already at the club, 25 with add data (25 of them from the 2026 row), 0 market rows inserted, 134 stints), 21 also in an earlier file, 0 refused
--   Ligue 1: 39 rows, 13 accepted (13 market moves, 0 already at the club, 4 with add data (4 of them from the 2026 row), 0 market rows inserted, 13 stints), 26 also in an earlier file, 0 refused
--   Missing players: 4 rows, 3 accepted (0 market moves, 0 already at the club, 3 with add data (0 of them from the 2026 row), 3 market rows inserted, 0 stints), 0 also in an earlier file, 1 refused
